the ending.\n\n{1292510498519654}\n\nFinally\nThis title includes an auto-save system that records your progress automatically.  \n However, please note that there is no option to reset your data.\n\nJust like your real-life youth was a once-in-a-lifetime experience, the youth you live through in this game is also unique and fleeting.   \nCherish each moment and enjoy the present to the fullest.\n", "short_description": "\"SchoolFriendMemories Vol.2\" is a romance adventure game where you can experience the youthful days of high school, centering around everyday conversations with Akari Akesaka, a senior aiming for art school.\n\nAs the protagonist, you will relive the process of gradually deepening your bond with the heroine through daily interactions.\n\nEnjoy a moment of youth in a VR space that brings the school atmosphere to life."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "sozai1.png", "id": "2356403878065960", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392301_2356403881399293_5160666627903576270_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nV2SVSjQVosQ7kNvwEEWpTI&_nc_oc=Adrj_shSx47ugRt-48pgsyaEkbLAXiuVTKlm1fw9heT6J3RR7-j4PkG1HzZ0uMSLmI8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSIAcpt7jmZMXtx8kq8FifFZlM5h5hR_mDH79XyXjdoBQ&oe=6AFB1F70"}, {"file_name": "sozai5.png", "id": "1862155974567007", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392127_1862155981233673_6629870527784498539_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=j7XcQorG1icQ7kNvwHCe4SV&_nc_oc=AdrRKVwUgHrSir6qq1z3jAM9sSN4QSDjrxQ0Az7ql3bdoDPOBb2p475x76vZji2PkaM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTnJMrMwD9Q8sxyfIHY9oXt-vNCuErEm8glDeKNWNmKig&oe=6AFB3A67"}, {"file_name": "sozai2.png", "id": "1198978045112343", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-l